    <string name="hero_title_emphasis">served warm.</string>
    <string name="hero_body">Edikang Ikong, Afang, Ekpang Nkukwo and the great pots of Akwa-Cross, cooked the way they have always been. Plus continental favourites and fresh juices pressed every morning.</string>
